# Plasticine 自更新（Linux 安装包）：查发布清单，有新版就下载、核对 SHA-256、换上、重启、健康检查，不健康自动退回。
# 由 plasticine-update.timer 开机后和每天触发；马上查一次：systemctl start plasticine-update.service。

[Unit]
Description=Plasticine 自更新
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
EnvironmentFile=-/etc/plasticine/plasticine.env
ExecStart=/opt/plasticine/node/bin/node /opt/plasticine/current/scripts/packages/update.ts update \
  --root /opt/plasticine --restart-command "systemctl restart plasticine.service"
